# ==== ACCOUNTS ====
### create account
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "f6a568d5-93fe-44aa-bacd-e2b6e1ee7c0e"
}

### get unique account
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/030ca590-d7f2-45ce-aa5c-8dee5745adc3

### list all accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts

### delete account with google
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/accounts/e4393ebc-09aa-4c3b-a76b-d14f822ac86d

### import from google
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/import/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orgPath": "/Integrador-teste/Maplebear - Krypton"
}

